From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mangue OS <noreply@mangueos>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: dts: allwinner: MangoPi MQ Pro header overlays

43 overlays for the 40-pin header, all off by default; enabled with
fdtoverlays in extlinux.conf (mqpro-io). Generated by tools/gen_overlays.py.
---
diff --git a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
@@ -10,3 +10,6 @@
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun20i-d1-mangopi-mq-pro.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun20i-d1-nezha.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun20i-d1s-mangopi-mq.dtb
+
+# Mangue OS: MQ Pro header overlays
+subdir-y += overlay
